     "conditional_commitment_rule": "For each entry in conditional_commitments, if at least one occurrence whose event_id equals if_event_id is scheduled, then at least minimum_then_scheduled occurrences whose event_id is listed in then_event_ids must also be scheduled. If no if_event_id occurrence is scheduled, that entry imposes no minimum.",
